    <string name="mcp_help_steps">1. Tap Start service.\n2. Tap Local address to copy it.\n3. Open an AI app that supports MCP (for example RikkaHub), go to its MCP Server settings and add a new server.\n4. Choose Streamable HTTP and paste the address.\n5. Save, then enable that server in a chat.\n6. Ask the AI in plain language, for example: \"List all installed apps\" or \"Check the permissions of the APK in Download\".\n\nAn AI app on another phone or a computer uses the LAN address, and the Wi-Fi access switch must be turned on first.</string>
